Error [jet.FixedTimingSteer]: A `Secret` value decides a struct comparison (a struct's `==` and `compare` leave at the first field that differs)
  --> tests/ui/taint/fixed_timing_struct_field_tag_refuses_struct_comparison.jet:7:50
    |
  7 | same: fn(a: SealedWord, b: SealedWord) -> Bool { a == b }
    |                                                  ^^^^^^
 Why: `Secret` is `timing: .Fixed`: which code runs, how long it takes and which addresses it touches must not depend on it
 Fix: Compute both outcomes and choose with a masked select, or reveal the value through a `#Scrub(Secret)` function first
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0737
